<title>UK: Lucas Industries seen firm on profit rise.</title>
<headline>Lucas Industries seen firm on profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Lucas Industries were expected to strengthen on Tuesday after the company reported better-than-expected pretax profits.</p>
<p>In its last annual results statement before the merger to form LucasVarity Plc pretax profits before exceptional items rose 41 percent to 191 million stg.</p>
<p>Shares in LucasVarity were up 1/2p at 250p in pre-market trade at 0707 GMT.</p>
</text>
